{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of <strong>METAL EDEN</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains the first two missions from the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>METAL EDEN</strong> is an adrenaline-rush sci-fi FPS. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The advanced <strong>HYPER UNIT ASKA</strong> is sent on a suicide mission to rescue the citizens\u2019 <strong>CORES</strong> from the vast monolithic city <strong>MOEBIUS</strong> - once a hopeful new home for humanity now turned into a deadly trap. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your way through the <strong>INTERNAL DEFENCE CORPS</strong> in cybernetic warfare, confront the <strong>ENGINEERS</strong> and uncover the mysteries of the project <strong>EDEN</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468980?t=1744127643","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744127643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468980/1e59432daaf33cef01539a9e3f272201bf2957b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744127643","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468980/1e59432daaf33cef01539a9e3f272201bf2957b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744127643","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains strong, violence, blood and gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of <strong>METAL EDEN</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains the first two missions from the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>METAL EDEN</strong> is an adrenaline-rush sci-fi FPS. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The advanced <strong>HYPER UNIT ASK